## How this was produced

Each participant's own audio track was transcribed (exact attribution). Video was sampled at
{{view.video.fps}} frame(s) per second plus frames at turn boundaries and flagged moments. The
session was cut into {{view.analysis.segmentMs}} ms segments; each segment of a participant whose
role is cut into segments was written to the recording store, sealed, and only an analysed
participant's segments were sent to the model ({{view.analysis.provider}} / {{view.analysis.model}},
through the `{{view.analysis.channel}}` channel): {{view.analysis.results}} results,
{{view.analysis.failed}} failed, {{view.analysis.notAnalysed}} not analysed.

Expression, engagement and emotion are advisory estimates by a model, for the people reading this
report. They are not a decision about anyone, and no participant was identified.
